[00:22.64]I assume our time was forever, naturally seemed forever
{"我原以为我们的时光会是永恒，自然得像永恒一般"}
[00:33.73]Those happy days we spent together
{"那些我们共度的快乐时光"}
[00:39.32]Cause you were always beside me
{"因为你始终陪伴在我身旁"}
[00:47.22]Then suddenly I realized, these happy days won’t ever last
{"而后我突然意识到，这些快乐日子终将消逝"}
[00:58.33]Out of all the souls we create, in fact, how we met was a miracle
{"在所有我们创造的灵魂中，相遇本就是奇迹"}
[01:12.13]I see you peacefully, you’re in your dreams
{"我静静凝望你，你正沉入梦乡"}
[01:18.61]Everything seems calm and free
{"万物显得安宁而自由"}
[01:23.14]I know, If we want this warmth to last forever again
{"我明白，若想再度留住这份温暖"}
[01:31.86]Let’s go back to that moment of day
{"就让我们回到那一天那一刻"}
[01:37.52]
[01:57.46]As time goes by and we all change
{"时光流逝万物变迁"}
[02:03.03]And not just us, the world keeps changing
{"不仅是我们，世界也在不断改变"}
[02:08.50]But little did I know that this was coming
{"但我未曾预知这结局的来临"}
[02:14.12]Cause you were there always smiling
{"因你总是带着微笑守候在那里"}
[02:21.97]I wonder how you’ll be in the future
{"我好奇未来的你会是什么模样"}
[02:27.46]I wouldn’t know it’s hard to figure
{"这答案太难揣测"}
[02:32.94]But by accepting this feeling inside, will eventually create a miracle
{"但只要接纳心底这份情感，终将创造新的奇迹"}
[02:47.12]I see you smiling there,
{"我看见你在那里微笑"}
[02:50.43]So peacefully and cheerfully, I see you talk at me
{"如此宁静欢欣，我听见你对我诉说"}
[02:58.88]These happy days must carry on
{"这些快乐时光必须延续下去"}
[03:04.35]So once again let’s go back to that day
{"所以让我们再次回到那一天"}
[03:09.42]To where we had hand in hand
{"回到我们十指相扣的地方"}
[03:16.69]
[03:42.80]I see you peacefully, you’re in your dreams
{"我静静凝望你，你正沉入梦乡"}
[03:48.82]Everything seems calm and free
{"万物显得安宁而自由"}
[03:53.79]I know, If we want this warm to last forever again
{"我明白，若想再度留住这份温暖"}
[04:02.58]Let’s go back to that moment of day
{"就让我们回到那一天那一刻"}
[04:10.69]I see you smiling there,
{"我看见你在那里微笑"}
[04:14.10]So peacefully and cheerfully, talking at me
{"如此宁静欢愉　向我诉说"}
[04:22.76]These happy days must carry on
{"这些快乐时光必须延续"}
[04:27.78]So once again let’s go back to the start
{"让我们再次回到起点"}
[04:37.47]This goodbye is not the end
{"这次告别并非终点"}
[04:40.64]I know until we meet again, our feelings will remain the same
{"我知道重逢之前　我们的心意始终如一"}
[04:50.48]Together as one, till we find ourselves again
{"同心一体　直到我们再度相遇"}
[05:00.46]
